Twenty percent is not a suggestion. It is the number that ends the hesitation at the register, the one figure that works for almost every pedicure you will ever get. <strong>How much to tip for a pedicure</strong> comes down to a simple range, 15 to 20 percent of the service price, and this guide converts that into an exact dollar figure for your price point so you stop doing math on a glowing tip screen while someone waits on your answer. <strong>How much to tip for a pedicure</strong> is not a mystery once the rule is separated from the arithmetic.

